   a. Nutrient enrichment: Biomogas and other energy sources from biomass can be used as a fertilizer, which can help to increase the availability of essential nutrients in the soil, such as nitrogen, phosphorus, and potassium. This can help to improve the growth and yield of crops, as well as the overall health of the soil.
