\]
Since $\nabla f(x^+) \text{ is constant}, \inf \nabla f(x^+) \geq 0$.

Thus, $\nabla f(x^+) \geq 0$.

2. **Backward Direction**: Suppose $\forall y \in \mathcal{U} : \nabla f(x^+) (y - x^+) \geq 0$.

3. **Conclusion**: The conclusion is $\nabla f(x^+) \geq 0$.

