The total cost of the game is 6,000 dollars, so:  
\[ 250 \times 12t = 6000 \]  
\[ 3000t = 6000 \]  
\[ t = \frac{6000}{3000} = 2 \)  
Thus, the new repayment period is \(\boxed{2}\) years.
</ASSISTANT_RESPONSE>

