Can the product \( n(n+1) \) be a perfect power for any natural number \( n \)?<end_of_turn>
<start_of_turn>model
","To determine if \( n(n+1) \) can be a perfect power for any natural number \( n \), we consider the case where \( n(n+1) = k^m \) for positive integers \( n, k, m \geq 2 \).

