\[
\nabla F = \left( \frac{\partial F}{\partial x}, \frac{\partial F}{\2 \partial y}, \frac{\partial F}{\partial z} \right) = (2x, 2y, 18z).
\]
At the point \((4,2,-2)\), the gradient is:
\[
\nabla F(4,2,-2) = (2 \times 4, 2 \times 2, 18 \times (-2)) = (8, 4, -36).
