- \( d = 0.2 \, \text{m} \) (radius of the loop)
- \( \pi = 3.14159 \)

Substituting the values:
\[
B = \frac{2\pi \times 1}{0.2} = \frac{2\pi}{0.2} = 10\pi
\]
\[
