\[
I = I_0 e^{-\sigma \nu \sigma_0}
\]  
where \( \sigma = \alpha + \beta \) is the total absorption and emission cross-section, and \( \omega_0 = \frac{h c}{\lambda} \) is the angular frequency of the incident light.  

