- \( d = \text{displacement} = 10.0 \, \text{m} \)
- \( \theta = \text{angle between force and displacement} = 60.0° \)

Substituting the values:

\[
W = 60.0 \, \text{N} \cdot 10.0 \, \text{m} \cdot \cos 60.0°
\]

