6. **Relating mass of displaced air to mass flow rate:**
   The mass flow rate (0.3 kg/s) is the mass of air passing through the flowmeter per second. The buoyant force is equal to the weight of the displaced air. The mass of displaced air is the mass of air displaced by the conical body.

7. **Equilibrium Condition:**
